{
	"name": "Questing",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/environment/wilderness/terrain-river-road-gray.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 6th level, your focus and drive as a champion to a cause grow immensely. Once per long rest you can declare a Quest. Choose a goal that you can achieve before your next long rest, such as reaching the summit of a mountain you're traversing or rescuing a noble who has been kidnapped. You immediately gain inspiration and ignore the effects of fatigue, including the doomed condition, until your chosen quest ends. In addition, you have advantage on saving throws against Charms and Illusions which would sway you from your quest.</p>",
